# J4: run on N cores, monitor, reconstruct. Target: one control for N; decomposition always consistent.
open $SB/ws/cavity
measure
budget p95 16.7 max 100
click nav:run
wait-until page Run
click np-in
enter 4
wait 3
assert text Parallel with mpirun on 4
click run-go
wait-until job running timeout 10
wait-until job finished timeout 120
assert log log.decomposePar Number of processor faces
assert log log.icoFoam nProcs : 4
assert log log.reconstructPar Time = 0.5
assert file processor3
assert file 0.5/U
screenshot $OUT/j4_done.png
